# Sibling paths

Pairs or groups of code paths that must change together. A fix on one and not its sibling is the most common miss,
so `/operate` and the review rounds check this list. Add a row whenever a review finds a missed sibling. Delete the
example row once you add real ones.

| Paths | Why they move together |
|---|---|
| `server/validate/signup.*` + `server/validate/invite.*` | Example only: both accept the same email field and must normalize it the same way |
